5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am curious about the ground. It feels important to know what is under our feet before we start.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,Hello everyone. I am here to look at the numbers. I want to see what this will cost us later.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, dear. I have seen many plans come and go. I want to see what remains.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am thinking about who will actually do the work. The staff numbers seem low to me.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let us not guess. We need data on how people actually use this space right now.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, do you have any specific figures in mind? I am just trying to understand the scope.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, I am looking at the long-term ledger. The initial price is never the real price.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I agree with May. The drawings are pretty, but the reality is what matters.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I am checking the staffing roll. If we do not have people, the plan is just paper.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I am looking at the traffic counts. We need to know where the feet go.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I am worried about the clay. It can be tricky. I want to check the firms.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I will look at the upkeep costs. I want to see the trend over the last few years.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I want to see the condition of the old works. It tells us a lot about quality.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will check the volunteer groups. They might be the key to keeping it alive.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the drainage issues. The heat and the rain are our real enemies.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I think we should be careful. The ground is not just dirt. It has a history.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,Exactly. The history is in the accounts. I will find out what it costs to keep.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"Yes, the history is in the cracks. I will look at what has survived.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,The people are the history too. I will see who is willing to help.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,The data will tell us the truth. Let us see what the numbers say.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
